  Lines:
  - SpeakerName: Dwarf Forge-Master
    DialogueText: By the forge's fire... you wiped them out completely! You have
      our gratitude, Sovereign. Our forges burn for you now.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
