  - SpeakerName: Mercenary
    DialogueText: The smiths are already working. Our troops will be heavily armed.
    PortraitLeft: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitMiddle: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitRight: {fileID: 0}
    Background: {fileID: 0}
    Focus: 0
    BackgroundOverlay: 0
    EventID: 
    VoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - SpeakerName: Lilith
    DialogueText: The mountain is ours to command. But I hear sounds of conflict
      higher up the peaks...
